{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TextBufferCommitNotify"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"GtkTextBufferCommitNotify","preciseIdentifier":"c:gtktextbuffer.h@T@GtkTextBufferCommitNotify"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You may not modify the [class"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/TextBuffer"},{"type":"text","text":"] from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[callback"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/TextBufferCommitNotify"},{"type":"text","text":"] callback and that is enforced"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the [class"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/TextBuffer"},{"type":"text","text":"] API."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"[callback"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/TextBufferCommitNotify"},{"type":"text","text":"] may be used to be notified about"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes to the underlying buffer right before-or-after the changes are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"committed to the underlying B-Tree. This is useful if you want to observe"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes to the buffer without other signal handlers potentially modifying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state on the way to the default signal handler."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flags"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GTK_TEXT_BUFFER_NOTIFY_BEFORE_INSERT"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"type":"text","text":" is set to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the offset in characters from the start of the buffer where the insertion"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will occur. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" is set to the number of characters to be inserted.  You"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"may not yet retrieve the text until it has been inserted. You may access the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"text from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GTK_TEXT_BUFFER_NOTIFY_AFTER_INSERT"},{"type":"text","text":" using"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[method"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gtk.TextBuffer.get_slice"},{"type":"text","text":"]."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flags"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GTK_TEXT_BUFFER_NOTIFY_AFTER_INSERT"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"type":"text","text":" is set to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offset in characters where the insertion occurred and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" is set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the number of characters inserted."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flags"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GTK_TEXT_BUFFER_NOTIFY_BEFORE_DELETE"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"type":"text","text":" is set to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offset in characters where the deletion will occur and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" is set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the number of characters that will be removed. You may still retrieve"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the text from this handler using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flags"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GTK_TEXT_BUFFER_NOTIFY_AFTER_DELETE"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" is set to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"zero to denote that the delete-range has already been committed to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"underlying B-Tree. You may no longer retrieve the text that has been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deleted from the [class"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/TextBuffer"},{"type":"text","text":"]."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gtk\/textbuffercommitnotify"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk\/TextBufferCommitNotify","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A notification callback used by [method"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gtk.TextBuffer.add_commit_notify"},{"type":"text","text":"]."}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TextBufferCommitNotify"}],"title":"TextBufferCommitNotify","roleHeading":"Type Alias","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"typealias","externalID":"s:3Gtk22TextBufferCommitNotifya","modules":[{"name":"Gtk"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TextBufferCommitNotify"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gtk\/documentation\/Gtk"]]},"references":{"